WEBVTT

00:01.837 --> 00:04.843
He's been shot all over his body,
mainly in the internal organs,

00:04.843 --> 00:05.929
more than a dozen times.

00:06.847 --> 00:08.893
He's made it out of the woods somehow...

00:09.686 --> 00:13.819
but if it hadn't been for Big Bro Shinzo's
first aid, it would have been too late.

00:40.163 --> 00:43.921
We have an injured person
among us at the moment.

00:45.132 --> 00:46.009
Let's go!

00:57.782 --> 00:59.870
Activate Hibernation.

01:09.556 --> 01:10.474
That voice...

01:10.975 --> 01:11.935
Don't panic.

01:12.436 --> 01:15.275
They're not out to kill Mutsumi.

01:18.490 --> 01:23.501
Either way, Hibernation can only
be disabled with the head's ring.

01:24.418 --> 01:26.130
I'll leave the Tanpopo battalion to you.

01:27.383 --> 01:33.228
I'm going to get the previous head's ring
back from him.

01:40.367 --> 01:41.620
A blackout?

01:44.626 --> 01:46.087
Everything's shut down.

01:46.672 --> 01:49.678
But this room should have backup power.

01:50.220 --> 01:51.932
What on earth is happening?

02:01.367 --> 02:02.202
NANAO
NO CONNECTION

02:02.202 --> 02:04.916
It's no good.
I can't get through to anyone.

02:05.668 --> 02:08.006
They've cut off all communications, too.

02:12.974 --> 02:14.351
His pulse is getting weaker!

02:16.523 --> 02:17.525
What should I do?

02:18.026 --> 02:19.236
If this keeps up...

02:19.905 --> 02:21.491
Taiyo will die.

02:37.272 --> 02:46.875
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

03:54.511 --> 04:01.065
PLAN 16
CLEANING THE YARD

04:06.409 --> 04:09.415
The Cherry Blossom Ring
that you shared with the ninth head...

04:10.751 --> 04:14.258
it gives you the same authority as
the head over Hibernation and the like.

04:15.301 --> 04:17.724
You have no right to that ring...

04:19.853 --> 04:20.688
Father.

04:24.445 --> 04:26.616
I can't possibly leave this room.

04:27.409 --> 04:29.581
But I have to do something, or...

04:41.061 --> 04:42.940
I'm pretty sure it was on this shelf.

04:45.361 --> 04:46.197
Found it!

04:54.589 --> 04:56.175
Listen to me, Mutsumi.

05:02.688 --> 05:08.366
The blood that flows in our veins
has a special power.

05:08.867 --> 05:11.205
A special power?

05:12.374 --> 05:13.459
That's right.

05:13.669 --> 05:18.219
By using that power,
you can do any kind of evil thing,

05:18.219 --> 05:21.183
but on the other hand, you can also
use it for extremely good things.

05:21.183 --> 05:22.435
Oh?

05:22.770 --> 05:27.655
The only thing is, great power
always comes with great suffering.

05:28.364 --> 05:32.122
If you ever want
to use this power for someone...

05:35.838 --> 05:40.138
then make sure that it's only
for someone you care about so much...

05:40.806 --> 05:44.731
that you'd want to accept
all of his suffering, too.

06:07.400 --> 06:10.031
Please... work.

06:12.327 --> 06:15.751
His temperature keeps going down.
His pulse, too.

06:16.586 --> 06:17.964
Don't do this to me, Taiyo!

06:19.091 --> 06:21.513
You're always saving me.

06:22.013 --> 06:24.894
I still haven't done anything for you!

06:28.442 --> 06:29.988
Please don't leave me!

06:45.018 --> 06:47.439
And now, mission accomplished.

06:58.252 --> 07:01.926
Don't you lay a hand on Mutsumi!

07:07.437 --> 07:09.149
Could this be...

07:10.736 --> 07:12.363
Get away from Mutsumi.

07:27.937 --> 07:28.897
Is this...

07:37.957 --> 07:39.502
What's going on here?

07:47.601 --> 07:49.187
My body feels so light.

07:50.816 --> 07:52.528
His movements look slow to me.

07:53.028 --> 07:53.864
No...

07:54.447 --> 07:56.034
I don't even need to see them!

07:56.911 --> 07:57.746
I know!

08:09.562 --> 08:10.438
I can beat him.

08:15.866 --> 08:16.993
I see.

08:17.493 --> 08:19.372
That's Yozakura blood, huh?

08:22.253 --> 08:25.677
The someinine is activating
the cells all over your body.

08:26.428 --> 08:28.432
But its sensitivity is so overwhelming

08:28.432 --> 08:31.438
that it destroys
the brain's processing power.

08:33.400 --> 08:37.868
Even in the case of Hazakura, half of us
end up dying because we can't tolerate it.

08:38.327 --> 08:41.333
It's either master it or die.

08:47.262 --> 08:48.932
Calm down, Taiyo.

08:49.432 --> 08:51.478
You have to keep your senses in focus.

08:51.771 --> 08:53.692
Mutsumi?

08:54.359 --> 08:55.779
It's no good. Just run--

08:55.779 --> 08:57.533
I can't leave you behind, Taiyo.

08:59.912 --> 09:02.918
It won't be easy
to get out of here, anyway,

09:02.918 --> 09:05.716
since they seem
to have activated Hibernation.

09:06.718 --> 09:10.182
But neither do I intend
to let them use my heart for evil.

09:13.606 --> 09:16.069
When we die, we're going to die together.

09:21.288 --> 09:22.206
Close your eyes.

09:23.543 --> 09:25.672
Breathe in and out slowly.

09:27.133 --> 09:28.887
Focus only...

09:29.847 --> 09:31.391
on my voice.

09:34.230 --> 09:37.153
Let it echo throughout your body...

09:39.407 --> 09:41.411
and feel it with your heart...

09:44.669 --> 09:46.881
...the fact that I'm right here with you.

10:03.288 --> 10:04.667
It's useless!

10:10.762 --> 10:12.850
You've said your goodbyes, right?

10:27.420 --> 10:28.590
I can...

10:29.132 --> 10:29.967
see you!

10:49.047 --> 10:50.424
What's going on here?

10:51.218 --> 10:52.846
I can't regenerate.

10:57.438 --> 10:58.983
You damned monster!

11:08.962 --> 11:13.972
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

11:19.942 --> 11:22.405
The ninth head's Cherry Blossom Ring...

11:22.990 --> 11:26.371
why don't you give it back... Father?

11:29.962 --> 11:32.008
You haven't changed at all, Kyoichiro.

11:32.008 --> 11:33.761
You're looking well.

11:35.139 --> 11:39.648
Futaba and your other siblings,
they're all looking well, too.

11:41.944 --> 11:43.447
Not to mention, it seems like...

11:44.198 --> 11:46.662
that boy's been awakened, too.

11:49.042 --> 11:52.173
No wonder I'm so proud of my kids.

11:55.346 --> 11:58.101
Still, this forest
hasn't changed, either, has it?

11:58.101 --> 12:01.525
Look at all these flowers
that you siblings planted in bl--

12:01.525 --> 12:02.778
Father.

12:05.366 --> 12:08.455
After all this time,
I'm not surprised to see you alive.

12:09.499 --> 12:10.334
But...

12:11.044 --> 12:14.510
why did you go so far
as to use Tanpopo to make Taiyo stronger?

12:18.559 --> 12:21.481
The blood of the Yozakura head
is a potent drug.

12:21.481 --> 12:25.907
More than a few people
have sought its power, only to perish.

12:26.993 --> 12:29.623
Mutsumi herself never
would have resorted to such a tactic

12:29.623 --> 12:32.044
unless she was facing a crisis.

12:33.548 --> 12:37.054
And so, you created a crisis.

12:41.062 --> 12:43.025
Knowing that Nanao would treat him,

12:43.025 --> 12:45.989
you dealt him a possibly fatal blow,
minus any murderous intent.

12:46.991 --> 12:51.207
You used the Hazakura Battalion
and Hibernation to split us all up.

12:52.001 --> 12:54.798
You made them cut off
the mansion's electricity

12:54.798 --> 12:57.721
because doing so
would turn off the house's traps.

12:57.721 --> 12:59.683
Isn't that the idea
you put into their heads?

13:02.689 --> 13:06.029
And so, Mutsumi,
now with her back against the wall,

13:06.029 --> 13:07.783
had no choice but to gamble

13:07.783 --> 13:09.995
on the Yozakura blood
being compatible with Taiyo.

13:11.039 --> 13:13.251
Why would you drag
all these people into your plot,

13:13.251 --> 13:16.424
mock them, and deceive them?
All for Taiyo?

13:17.886 --> 13:20.265
There's nothing odd about that, is there?

13:21.351 --> 13:26.069
I want him to be a strong enough husband
who can fully protect my beloved Mutsumi.

13:26.069 --> 13:28.198
I'm just being a father.

13:29.158 --> 13:32.414
What about you? You sure seem to be
fixated on that husband of hers.

13:32.414 --> 13:34.795
Are you that taken with him?

13:34.795 --> 13:35.964
Not by a long shot.

13:35.964 --> 13:38.426
I wish he would have died, if possible.

13:38.928 --> 13:40.013
I see.

13:40.640 --> 13:44.105
All right, I've achieved my goal,
so I'll be leaving now.

13:44.690 --> 13:46.944
I'm sorry about Goliath.

13:46.944 --> 13:48.280
You take care now.

13:52.454 --> 13:55.085
You're the same as ever,
aren't you, Father?

13:57.799 --> 14:02.141
Arrogant and smug, and you can't
even fathom how your own family feels.

14:03.268 --> 14:06.316
Apparently, Mother's death
has taught you nothing.

14:07.694 --> 14:09.698
Stay away from those two.

14:15.125 --> 14:16.461
Calm Storm.

14:33.663 --> 14:34.497
Taiyo!

14:34.497 --> 14:36.125
Whoa!

14:36.417 --> 14:39.340
Don't do this to me, Taiyo!
Please don't die!

14:39.340 --> 14:41.427
Uh, actually, I'm alive.

14:41.427 --> 14:45.310
What am I going to do? The side effects
of the Yozakura blood are making Taiyo--

14:45.310 --> 14:47.064
Hey, Mutsumi! Come on!

14:47.272 --> 14:49.695
I-I know! Artificial respiration.

14:53.661 --> 14:55.330
Thanks, Mutsumi.

14:55.915 --> 14:57.836
Thanks to you, I'm saved.

14:58.461 --> 14:59.881
Taiyo.

15:01.677 --> 15:04.015
All right!

15:04.015 --> 15:06.269
I finally got us connected!

15:06.269 --> 15:07.981
Damn it, what a train wreck!

15:08.398 --> 15:10.152
Mutsumi! Are you guys okay?

15:10.653 --> 15:13.743
Yes! We're both fine, Big Sis Shion!

15:14.703 --> 15:18.209
But I thought all communications
got cut off during Hibernation.

15:18.209 --> 15:19.253
How did you--

15:19.253 --> 15:23.470
I rebuilt the emergency hotline
from way back when.

15:23.846 --> 15:27.311
All right! Just stand by for now
without deactivating Hibernation.

15:27.896 --> 15:30.568
So both Mutsumi and Taiyo
are safe and sound, okay? Big Sis!

15:32.279 --> 15:33.616
Right! Roger that!

15:41.715 --> 15:44.386
Now, then, sorry to keep you all waiting.

15:45.556 --> 15:47.434
It's time to clean the yard.

15:47.852 --> 15:49.146
- Okay!
- Okay!

15:49.898 --> 15:51.317
I'll go first.

15:53.906 --> 15:55.117
Kengo, can you hear me?

15:55.618 --> 15:56.787
You bet!

15:57.079 --> 16:01.170
I'm going to guide you along
the shortest route to capturing them all.

16:02.047 --> 16:03.926
Kengo, you lure them in.

16:04.301 --> 16:05.470
Roger!

16:08.476 --> 16:10.480
Stand by! Okay!

16:11.065 --> 16:11.984
There she is!

16:12.442 --> 16:13.612
It's the Yozakura head!

16:14.113 --> 16:15.448
Get her!

16:18.371 --> 16:20.543
Start out by turning south right there!

16:20.543 --> 16:21.628
Roger that!

16:21.628 --> 16:24.341
All right! Once you've got
that group breathing down your neck,

16:24.341 --> 16:25.595
circle around to your right!

16:25.595 --> 16:26.805
Okay!

16:28.684 --> 16:30.061
A thousand, was it?

16:30.061 --> 16:32.107
I've got most of them following me!

16:35.573 --> 16:37.827
All right! We've got her cornered!

16:37.827 --> 16:41.500
Oh, I'm so scared! Save me, Nanao!

16:41.500 --> 16:43.672
The only one we're capturing
is the Yozakura head!

16:43.672 --> 16:45.217
Just kill the fourth son!

16:45.383 --> 16:48.181
Hang on to me real tight, Big Bro Kengo!

17:00.288 --> 17:01.833
What the-- It's a pitfall!

17:03.879 --> 17:05.298
What a great view!

17:06.092 --> 17:07.887
Go ahead, Big Bro Shinzo!

17:08.304 --> 17:09.557
Roger that.

17:11.853 --> 17:13.231
Wh-What the hell?

17:17.657 --> 17:19.451
W-We're trapped!

17:19.451 --> 17:20.997
Let us the hell outta here!

17:21.289 --> 17:24.378
I've never put a thousand people in one.

17:24.378 --> 17:25.673
Wonder if it'll make it...

17:26.257 --> 17:27.635
strength-wise and all?

17:29.388 --> 17:31.100
Damn it! So damn hard!

17:31.560 --> 17:33.187
Not even shooting it works!

17:39.033 --> 17:40.870
Okay, here it comes.

17:45.211 --> 17:48.134
Doing this
is so bad for my stiff shoulders.

17:48.426 --> 17:50.472
Don't ever come here again.

18:01.118 --> 18:02.830
Yay!

18:02.830 --> 18:03.707
Serves you right!

18:04.208 --> 18:06.295
That's our Big Sis Futaba!

18:06.295 --> 18:09.259
Hey, wasn't today burnable garbage day?

18:17.401 --> 18:20.115
You've gotten stronger, Kyoichiro...

18:20.490 --> 18:23.539
way stronger than I was at your age.

18:24.791 --> 18:28.674
But I'm the one who taught you
how to hold Steel Spider, how to bend it,

18:28.674 --> 18:29.926
how to spread it out...

18:30.594 --> 18:33.600
I taught you everything.

18:33.600 --> 18:35.646
And I'm still out of your league.

18:35.980 --> 18:39.486
Now, then,
see your father off like a good son.

18:39.486 --> 18:43.704
Didn't I tell you from the get-go
that you're giving back that ring?

18:46.125 --> 18:49.549
Surely you have no need for the keys
to the house that you abandoned?

18:50.008 --> 18:53.515
I'm so proud to see how you've all grown.

19:05.915 --> 19:08.211
Families are hard, huh?

19:19.274 --> 19:21.070
You guys!

19:21.320 --> 19:24.117
I'm so glad that you're both safe.

19:24.117 --> 19:25.913
Taiyo protected me, you know!

19:26.413 --> 19:28.752
- Taiyo!
- Whoa!

19:28.752 --> 19:31.716
- My bad! It was all my fault!
- Ouch, ouch, ouch...

19:31.716 --> 19:34.471
No, no, it wasn't your fault, Big Bro!

19:34.471 --> 19:37.520
- Hey, hey...
- Sorry, Taiyo!

19:37.520 --> 19:41.277
But what happened?
He was in such critical condition.

19:41.778 --> 19:43.740
I'll tell you all about it later, okay?

19:43.949 --> 19:46.705
Oh, man! Sorry, Taiyo!

19:51.756 --> 19:53.635
Taiyo, calm down!

19:55.639 --> 19:56.891
What's gotten into you?

19:56.891 --> 19:58.604
It's all right, Mutsumi. Just step back!

19:58.937 --> 20:01.943
Hey, great to see you all in one piece!

20:01.943 --> 20:03.446
Big Bro Kyoichiro!

20:03.697 --> 20:07.120
All right, why don't we head back
inside the mansion and have some tea?

20:08.331 --> 20:11.378
I'm just kidding, Futaba! Just kidding!

20:11.838 --> 20:13.634
He's crazy strong!

20:13.634 --> 20:15.554
Why would Taiyo--

20:15.554 --> 20:18.267
He got injected
with Big Sis Mutsumi's blood.

20:18.267 --> 20:20.898
Could this be
someinine-induced hyperactivity?

20:22.108 --> 20:23.862
That's right, Nanao.

20:24.404 --> 20:27.954
Someinine awakens all of the body's cells,

20:27.954 --> 20:31.001
but since it's
extremely difficult to control,

20:31.001 --> 20:32.337
quite often, the mind and body

20:32.337 --> 20:34.842
are unable to withstand
the blitz of excessive information

20:34.842 --> 20:36.303
and end up going berserk.

20:36.805 --> 20:38.474
Hey, this brings back fond memories!

20:38.474 --> 20:42.190
When we were little, we siblings
used to go berserk from time to time.

20:42.733 --> 20:44.987
This is no time to be basking in memories!

20:55.759 --> 20:58.974
He'll learn to control it bit by bit.

20:59.433 --> 21:01.145
But first, an emergency measure.

21:01.980 --> 21:02.690
DEATH SOUND DX
"BLAST MODE" CAN BE USED FOR TORTURE

21:02.982 --> 21:05.236
Huh? Are those my headphones?

21:05.779 --> 21:08.075
Even during rampages,

21:08.075 --> 21:11.541
the senses can prioritize
the voice of someone close to him.

21:12.042 --> 21:15.674
By focusing on that, we can
short-circuit his processing capacity

21:15.674 --> 21:17.887
and calm him down.

21:18.429 --> 21:19.932
And so, Mutsumi...

21:21.686 --> 21:23.105
can you sing us a song?

21:25.359 --> 21:28.825
Hold up, Kyoichiro! There are
tons of other ways to do this!

21:28.825 --> 21:31.079
MUTSUMI
Nope! This is the only way!

21:31.079 --> 21:32.917
This is all for Taiyo's sake!

21:32.917 --> 21:35.171
This is 100%
you wanting to hear her sing, isn't it?

21:35.672 --> 21:38.177
No, no, it's all right, Big Sis Futaba.

21:39.597 --> 21:41.058
It's for Taiyo's sake, after all.

21:51.830 --> 21:54.794
BLAST

21:57.298 --> 21:58.885
Taiyo!

22:01.390 --> 22:02.810
Huh? What?

22:05.524 --> 22:07.903
Taiyo!

22:07.903 --> 22:09.239
- Thank goodness!
- Thank goodness!

22:09.239 --> 22:11.159
Wh-What the heck happened?

22:11.661 --> 22:14.625
I heard a sound like the world
was coming to an end or something.

22:15.126 --> 22:17.923
A-A dream! That was just a dream, Taiyo!

22:20.512 --> 22:22.641
What's going on here, exactly?

22:23.392 --> 22:27.233
Don't we usually clobber someone
when we want to wake them up fast?

22:28.987 --> 22:29.822
Oh, please.

22:32.076 --> 22:33.788
Just a whim, that's all.

24:08.686 --> 24:10.982
NEXT TIME
NANAO'S MEDICINE
